# Data and results never go into git (this repository is public).
# data/ holds the Earth datasets (list, sources and checksums: python -m planet_earth.manifest);
# outputs/ holds runs, sweeps, reviews and model checkpoints.
/data/
/outputs/*
# ... except the probe and review scripts and their written rules (text only; runs, arrays and printouts stay out).
# Sweeps call these; promote one into planet_reviews when it becomes a standing measure (journal 149).
!/outputs/planet-calibration/
/outputs/planet-calibration/*
!/outputs/planet-calibration/precheck-*/
/outputs/planet-calibration/precheck-*/**
!/outputs/planet-calibration/precheck-*/**/
!/outputs/planet-calibration/precheck-*/**/*.py
!/outputs/planet-calibration/precheck-*/**/*.md
!/outputs/review-astra/
/outputs/review-astra/**
!/outputs/review-astra/**/
